      "y": 1174,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 81,
      "text": "grant SET_TEXT at  resource(namehash, partHash(key))\n\nagent-endpoint[mcp]   controller   ok\nagent-context         controller   revert   EACUnauthorizedAccountRoles\nagent-registration    controller   revert   EACUnauthorizedAccountRoles",
