    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t176",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "identifiers, labels, provisioning progress, cached snapshots, the activity log.\nno identity, permission, trust or policy answer.\n\nALLOWED_COLUMNS is a hand-maintained second list, checked against information_schema,\nso adding a column is a deliberate edit rather than a migration side effect.\n\nSnapshot<T> is branded and every snapshot table requires NOT NULL fetched_at, because a\ncached value that reaches the interface without its read time is indistinguishable from a live read.",
      "originalText": "identifiers, labels, provisioning progress, cached snapshots, the activity log.\nno identity, permission, trust or policy answer.\n\nALLOWED_COLUMNS is a hand-maintained second list, checked against information_schema,\nso adding a column is a deliberate edit rather than a migration side effect.\n\nSnapshot<T> is branded and every snapshot table requires NOT NULL fetched_at, because a\ncached value that reaches the interface without its read time is indistinguishable from a live read.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
